# EmailJS credentials for the contact form (https://www.emailjs.com)
# 1. Create a free account and connect your mail (e.g. grishbar@mail.ru)
# 2. Create an Email Service -> copy the Service ID
# 3. Create an Email Template with variables {{from_name}}, {{from_email}}, {{message}} -> copy the Template ID
# 4. Account -> General -> copy the Public Key
# 5. Copy this file to .env and fill the values, then restart the dev server
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
